title: "Two-sided Bayesian go/kill rules for preclinical candidate confirmation"
abstract: >-
  Code and results reproducing the comparison of seven decision rules for
  preclinical go/kill gates on three public datasets, including the proposed
  exact-belief rule with one-step look-ahead stopping.
